From fc7176c4f3c7c0cc8db70a27ce4e93f779e6ef26 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Nathana=C3=ABl=20Hannebert?=
 <nathanael.hannebert@vates.tech>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 21:30:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: keep downloaded files intact, track written files, avoid
 leaking secrets

- write files as downloaded (no axios JSON parsing, which crashed
  writeFileSync on JSON documents)
- default performCleanup to false with noRuntimeDownloads, so builds no
  longer delete content downloaded with the CLI
- record written files in a manifest: cleanup handles files renamed by
  modifyContent, and a new download removes stale files
- accept async documents and modifyContent functions
- accept requestConfig as a function, which Docusaurus does not serialize
  into the client bundle (#79)
- name the failing document in download errors
- refuse to write outside of outDir
---
