index 2510e7c..f8aed3f 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -1,5 +1,29 @@
 # Changelog
 
+## Unreleased
+
+Bug fixes:
+
+-   Files are written as downloaded: JSON documents are no longer parsed by
+    axios, which made `writeFileSync` throw (`ERR_INVALID_ARG_TYPE`).
+-   `performCleanup` now defaults to `false` when `noRuntimeDownloads` is
+    `true`: `docusaurus build` no longer deletes content downloaded with the
+    CLI (and usually committed).
+-   Cleanup removes the files actually written, including files renamed by
+    `modifyContent`. The list is kept in `outDir/.remote-content-<name>.json`.
+-   Downloading again removes the files of documents that are no longer listed.
+-   `documents` can be an async function.
+-   Download errors name the failing document and source URL.
+-   Writing outside of `outDir` (e.g. a `modifyContent` filename with `..`) is
+    refused.
+
+New features:
+
+-   `requestConfig` can be a function, evaluated at download time. Unlike plain
+    values, functions are not serialized into the client bundle, so secrets
+    such as an `Authorization` header are not leaked (#79).
+-   `modifyContent` can be async.
+
 ## v4.0.0
 
 Breaking changes:
